    thinking: "**Discovering Centralization**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! I just realized that the crucial references are remarkably centralized. Every single one is neatly confined within just six specific files: `/src/config/steering.ts`, `/src/types/game.ts`, `/src/config/ships.ts`, `/src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`, and `/src/engine/FlightController.ts`. This is incredibly clean.\n\n\n"
