      content: "Task id \"49f9382e-a5a8-4ac9-ad38-8127f285cebb/task-39\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\n=== INITIAL DEFAULT SETTINGS ==={  \"aimBoundaryWidth\": 0.4,  \"aimBoundaryHeight\": 0.45,  \"aimBoundaryCornerRadius\": 0.25,  \"precisionSensitivity\": 0.5,  \"boundarySensitivity\": 0.3,  \"maxSensitivity\": 1.8,  \"accelerationDistance\": 240,  \"responseCurve\": 2,  \"angularSmoothing\": 0.08,  \"recoverySmoothing\": 0.12}locator.click: Timeout 30000ms exceeded.Call log:  - waiting for getByRole(\'button\', { name: /back/i })    at [eval]:49:53 {  log: [ \"  - waiting for getByRole(\'button\', { name: /back/i })\" ],  name: \'TimeoutError\'}"
      priority: MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH
