      full: "=== SETTINGS UI AUDIT ==={  \"controls\": [    {      \"id\": \"setting-precision-sens\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"0.5\",      \"min\": \"0.15\",      \"max\": \"1.5\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-boundary-sens\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"0.3\",      \"min\": \"0.1\",      \"max\": \"1\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-max-sens\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"1.8\",      \"min\": \"0.8\",      \"max\": \"3\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-accel-dist\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"240\",      \"min\": \"80\",      \"max\": \"500\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-response-curve\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"2\",      \"min\": \"1\",      \"max\": \"3.5\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-aim-boundary\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"0.4\",      \"min\": \"0.25\",      \"max\": \"0.7\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-angular-smooth\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"0.08\",      \"min\": \"0.02\",      \"max\": \"0.25\"    },    {      \"id\": \"setting-reticle-recovery\",      \"exists\": true,      \"value\": \"0.12\",      \"min\": \"0.04\",      \"max\": \"0.35\"    }  ],  \"panelFitsHorizontally\": true,  \"panelHeight\": 648,  \"scrollHeight\": 925}=== RESET & PERSISTENCE CHECK ==={\"v5Stored\":true,\"precisionSensitivity\":0.5}=== CONTINUOUS SWIPE OUT -> HOLD -> RETURN TRACE ===t=0.10s | clampedX=   90px | excess=    0px | zone=precision    | sensX=0.500 | yaw=  6.6 deg/st=0.20s | clampedX=  180px | excess=    0px | zone=precision    | sensX=0.500 | yaw= 23.6 deg/st=0.30s | clampedX=  256px | excess=   14px | zone=transition   | sensX=0.475 | yaw= 45.3 deg/st=0.40s | clampedX=  256px | excess=  104px | zone=acceleration | sensX=0.452 | yaw=   51 deg/st=0.50s | clampedX=  256px | excess=  194px | zone=acceleration | sensX=0.632 | yaw= 63.1 deg/st=0.60s | clampedX=  256px | excess=  284px | zone=acceleration | sensX=0.887 | yaw= 87.2 deg/st=0.70s | clampedX=  256px | excess=  284px | zone=acceleration | sensX=1.050 | yaw=111.5 deg/st=0.80s | clampedX=  256px | excess=  284px | zone=acceleration | sensX=1.121 | yaw=126.6 deg/st=0.90s | clampedX=  256px | excess= 98.5px | zone=acceleration | sensX=0.911 | yaw=122.5 deg/st=1.00s | clampedX=  221px | excess=    0px | zone=precision    | sensX=0.628 | yaw= 91.1 deg/st=1.10s | clampedX=  101px | excess=    0px | zone=precision    | sensX=0.556 | yaw= 48.8 deg/st=1.20s | clampedX=  -19px | excess=    0px | zone=precision    | sensX=0.524 | yaw= 16.2 deg/s=== ERRORS ===ZERO ERRORS"
